      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "K(i,w) = max(K(i-1,w), p_i + K(i-1,w-w_i))\nTake term only when w_i <= w; bases K(0,w)=K(i,0)=0",
      "originalText": "K(i,w) = max(K(i-1,w), p_i + K(i-1,w-w_i))\nTake term only when w_i <= w; bases K(0,w)=K(i,0)=0",
